s have been bugging out in their puzzle. If you've tried to place them on their layer as hard as you might and to no avail, rejoice! Because that issue should be resolved now.ChangelogFixedAn invalid detection of ladybug pieces in the \"Ladybug Fields\" puzzle.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T15:40:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926592","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4002220-1845383656397460","game_id":"steam-4002220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.8.2","summary":"A quick update to celebrate the demo release!It has been an exciting day, full of valuable feedback already. One of the most obvious issues players are having with the demo right now is not being able to intuit some of the gameplay mechanics.Well, no worries! FOLLOW THESE STEPS is all about following step-by-step instructions, and so with this update you will have more instructions to follow. If you get stuck, unsure what to do next, get into the pause menu and check out the brand new Quick Star","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T19:43:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397460","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4002220-1845383656395943","game_id":"steam-4002220","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Now Available!","summary":"Good day to you! And it is a good day, because the demo for FOLLOW THESE STEPS is finally out and live.If you like building things out of plastic bricks, give it a try and perhaps you will like building things out of our pieces too! No rush, no way to fail. Simply put on your favorite relaxing tunes and start constructing.In the demo you will find 3 puzzle sets to build, instructions included!Open and empty those foil packs;Sort through colorful pieces that fall out;Read the build steps, stack t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T10:31:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395943","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4002220-1844751498233790","game_id":"steam-4002220","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Coming Soon!","summary":"It has been a hot summer, made even hotter by a mighty push to bring the demo of Follow These Steps across the line — right in time for the upcoming Steam Next Fest event!Follow These Steps is a chill little game about building things out of colorful pieces, and you will be able to try it out yourself very soon! In the full game you will be able to play with dozens of puzzle sets, and also enjoy an open-ended creative mode that lets you build anything you can come up with.The soon-to-be-released","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T10:17:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233790","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:35:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4002220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4002220":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4002220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5292460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
